4. GROUP ACTIVITY DETECTION
============================================================

Before doing deep opportunity analysis, determine whether a group
has meaningful recent activity.

The system should inspect the available recent posts and determine:

    latest post age
    number of recent posts
    whether the group has meaningful activity

The exact activity threshold should be configurable.

For example:

