============================================================
5. IMPORTANT: SIX-DAY CUTOFF
============================================================

The scanner should NOT treat posts older than 6 days as
opportunities.

Freshness levels:

    0 - 60 seconds
        VERY_RECENT
        → THREE BEEPS

    > 60 seconds - 24 hours
        RECENT
        → TWO BEEPS

    > 24 hours - 6 days
        OLDER_BUT_RELEVANT
        → ONE BEEP

    > 6 days
        IGNORE

    UNKNOWN
        DO NOT treat as fresh
        DO NOT give a false freshness alert

The six-day limit is a HARD OPPORTUNITY CUTOFF.

============================================================
6. BEEP MEANING
============================================================

The number of beeps represents opportunity freshness.

    3 BEEPS
        post/comment is within 1 minute
        VERY_RECENT

    2 BEEPS
        within 24 hours
        RECENT

    1 BEEP
        within 6 days
        OLDER_BUT_RELEVANT

    0 BEEPS
        older than 6 days
        ignore

This is intentionally simple.

The user should immediately understand:

    3 = extremely fresh
    2 = fresh
    1 = still worth checking

